## Build Commands Reference

| Task               | Manual Command                                          | Script                |
| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------- |
| Compile circuit    | `cd circuits/masp && nargo compile`                     | `./scripts/build.sh`  |
| Generate VK        | `bb OLD_API write_vk -b target/masp.json -o vk.bin`     | `./scripts/build.sh`  |
| Build program      | `cd programs/solana-masp && cargo build-sbf`            | `./scripts/build.sh`  |
| Deploy to Surfpool | `solana program deploy ... --url http://127.0.0.1:8899` | `./scripts/deploy.sh` |
| Run E2E tests      | `PROGRAM_ID=<pubkey> node scripts/test_e2e.mjs`         | -                     |

