## Debugging

### Circuit Issues

```bash
nargo compile --show-ssa    # Verbose compilation
nargo test --show-output    # Test with output
bb OLD_API verify -p ./proof.bin -k ./vk.bin  # Verify proof locally
```

### Solana Program Issues

```bash
# View program logs
solana logs --url http://127.0.0.1:8899

# Simulate transaction
solana simulate <TX_BASE58> --url http://127.0.0.1:8899

# Check account
solana account <PUBKEY> --url http://127.0.0.1:8899
```

### E2E Issues

```bash
# Verbose output
DEBUG=* node scripts/test_e2e.mjs

# Check program is deployed
solana program show <PROGRAM_ID> --url http://127.0.0.1:8899
```

